{"ticker":"AZO","updated":"2026-10-23T22:39:57Z","profile":{"longName":"AutoZone, Inc.","shortName":"AutoZone, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"United States","website":"https://www.autozone.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":51765891072,"trailingPE":20.250284,"forwardPE":16.597347,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.54521,"pegRatio":1.38,"targetMeanPrice":3670.8635,"targetHighPrice":4700.0,"targetLowPrice":3000.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.056,"earningsGrowth":0.15,"grossMargins":0.52339,"operatingMargins":0.19969,"profitMargins":0.1265,"totalRevenue":20338554880,"beta":0.398,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":3996.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":2730.65,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"AutoZone, Inc. operates as a retailer and distributor of automotive replacement parts and accessories in the United States, Mexico, and Brazil. The company offers a product line for cars, sport utility vehicles, vans, and light duty trucks, including new and remanufactured automotive hard parts, maintenance items, accessories, and non-automotive products. It also provides A/C compressors, batteries and accessories, bearings, belts and hoses, calipers, chassis, clutches, CV axles, engines, fuel pumps, fuses, ignition and lighting products, mufflers, radiators, starters and alternators, thermostats, and water pumps, as well as tire repairs. In addition, the company provides maintenance products, such as antifreeze and windshield washer fluids; brake drums, rotors, shoes, and pads; brake and power steering fluids, and oil and fuel additives; oil and transmission fluids; oil, cabin, air, fuel, and transmission filters; oxygen sensors; paints and accessories; refrigerants and accessories; shock absorbers and struts; spark plugs and wires; and windshield wipers. Further, it offers air fresheners, cell phone accessories, drinks and snacks, floor mats and seat covers, interior and exterior accessories, mirrors, performance products, protectants and cleaners, sealants and adhesives, steering wheel covers, tools, vehicle entertainment systems, and wash and wax products, as well as towing","summary_zh":"AutoZone, Inc. 在美國、墨西哥和巴西經營汽車更換零件和配件的零售商和經銷商。該公司提供汽車、運動型多用途車、貨車和輕型卡車的產品線，包括新的和再製造的汽車硬零件、維修用品、配件和非汽車產品。它還提供空調壓縮機、電池和配件、軸承、皮帶和軟管、卡鉗、底盤、離合器、CV軸、引擎、燃油泵、保險絲、點火和照明產品、消音器、散熱器、起動機和交流發電機、恆溫器和水泵，以及輪胎維修。此外，該公司還提供維護產品，例如防凍劑和擋風玻璃清洗液；煞車鼓、轉子、煞車蹄片和煞車片；煞車油和動力轉向液，以及油和燃料添加劑；油和傳動液；機油、機艙、空氣、燃油和變速箱濾清器；氧氣塞感知器；油漆及配件和氣動裝置；此外，它還提供空氣清新劑、手機配件、飲料和零食、腳墊和座椅套、內部和外部配件、鏡子、高性能產品、保護劑和清潔劑、密封劑和粘合劑、方向盤套、工具、車輛娛樂系統、洗滌和打蠟產品以及拖車","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車零件","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":4100.0,"h":4141.5,"l":4086.8899,"c":4139.8301,"v":80200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":4145.8501,"h":4187.3701,"l":4117.2002,"c":4180.1699,"v":117500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":4216.02,"h":4216.02,"l":4164.02,"c":4205.4102,"v":113500},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":4187.2998,"h":4222.4399,"l":4172.77,"c":4197.0898,"v":78900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":4213.9902,"h":4229.6802,"l":4182.2598,"c":4198.5298,"v":89700},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":4198.0,"h":4225.0,"l":4165.1699,"c":4179.8398,"v":96700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":4174.9399,"h":4195.48,"l":4165.8198,"c":4189.48,"v":92200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":4195.1499,"h":4238.1899,"l":4180.0,"c":4232.96,"v":80600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":4237.0498,"h":4248.1401,"l":4200.0,"c":4219.4102,"v":92400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":4218.0,"h":4259.2202,"l":4218.0,"c":4242.8799,"v":112900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":4224.0,"h":4291.1201,"l":4204.3101,"c":4291.1201,"v":94100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":4282.0,"h":4304.9399,"l":4238.8901,"c":4252.8999,"v":99300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":4263.8799,"h":4388.1099,"l":4263.8799,"c":4354.54,"v":163200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":4316.6802,"h":4363.29,"l":4316.6802,"c":4322.1499,"v":100900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":4334.8101,"h":4357.8101,"l":4198.5601,"c":4233.2998,"v":166800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":4237.6001,"h":4285.3398,"l":4212.3398,"c":4223.9302,"v":118900},{"t"